<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/header-public') %>
<main>
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <%- include('../partials/flash') %>
    <div class="section">
      <div class="page-head">
        <h1>About <%= appName %></h1>
        <p><%= appTagline %></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-body">
        <h2 style="font-size:18px">What is <%= appName %>?</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 muted"><%= appName %> is a completely free engineering placement preparation platform. It exists for one purpose: to help engineering students prepare for placement tests and interviews through focused practice, real tests and honest analytics.</p>

        <hr class="divider">
        <h2 style="font-size:18px">The core loop</h2>
        <div class="mt-2 grid grid-2">
          <div><b>Practice</b><p class="small muted">Aptitude, reasoning, verbal, technical, coding and SQL - topic by topic.</p></div>
          <div><b>Test</b><p class="small muted">Quick quizzes, topic tests, sectionals, full mocks and company tests.</p></div>
          <div><b>Analyze</b><p class="small muted">Real scores, percentiles, rankings and performance analytics.</p></div>
          <div><b>Improve</b><p class="small muted">AI analysis points to your weak topics with recommended practice.</p></div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider">
        <h2 style="font-size:18px">Everything is free</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 muted">There are no premium plans, no paywalls, no locked content and no subscriptions. Every registered student gets access to everything, forever.</p>

        <hr class="divider">
        <h2 style="font-size:18px">What <%= appName %> is not</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 muted"><%= appName %> is not a career counselling service, job marketplace or generic chatbot. It focuses exclusively on placement test and interview preparation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
